-checkout.md) | 04 | 13 |\n| 06 | [Confirmation and booking lifecycle](06-confirmation.md) | 05 | 2 |\n| 07 | [Final pass](07-final-pass.md) | 01–06 | all |\n\nA ticket is done when every box in it is ticked and `pnpm nx build cinescope` succeeds.\n","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":18}}}
